      "title": "Office of the Academic Dean",
      "description": "Office of the Academic Dean | Transylvania University Skip to content Menu Search About About Transy Who We Are Quick Facts Our History Bingham Fund Employment Office of the President Administration President’s Staff An Excellent Value Academic Programs Explore Transy Campus Map Getting Started at Transy About Lexington Directions and Hotels What’s Nearby News & Events Reserving Campus Spaces Faculty & Staff Directory More Information Admissions & Aid Admission Important Deadlines College Planning Checklist Financial Aid & Scholarships Scholarships Net Price Calculator Apply Transy Application Portal Visit Connect with Admissions Find Your Admissions Counselor Parents and Families Academics Academic Overview Office of the Academic Dean Academic Calendar Commencement The Liberal Arts Your First Year Academic Requirements Digital Liberal Arts Majors & Minors Self-Designed Majors Preprofessional Accelerate KCTCS Pathways Graduate Partnerships Faculty Faculty Directory Faculty Development Office of the Registrar Course Catalog Units and Semester Hours Dual Credit Information Transcripts Study Abroad Costs and Scholarships Opportunities Library Academic Center for Excellence Transy Writing Center Center for Academic and Professional Enrichment Center for Entrepreneurship Campus Life Campus Life at Transy New Student Orientation Accessibility Services Spirituality and Religious Life Living on Campus Housing Dining Services Crimson Card Technology Services Student Life Student Wellbeing Sustainability Campus Engagement Student Life Staff Campus Center Transy Bookstore Campus Safety Meet the DPS Officers Title IX Career Development Start Your Career Students Mentorship Resources Transylvania University Office of the Academic Dean Welcome to Transylvania. It is a great pleasure to welcome you to Transylvania University. Our priority is to prepare you to lead a purposeful, authentic and successful life. The first step is finding your true path. Transylvania offers many opportunities to define your interests and your place in the world. Working closely with our esteemed faculty, you will thrive in the multidisciplinary world of the humanities, arts and sciences. Expect to build a broad foundation across disciplines and perspectives, developing understanding, knowledge and skills—including critical writing and thinking, quantitative reasoning and communication—that are essential to a global society. Through the liberal arts, we prepare you for a life fulfilled and to be ready for multiple pathways in the 21st century. I encourage you to challenge yourself to try new subjects and activities before choosing from a diverse range of majors, minors and preprofessional programs. There is no better way to develop your whole being and discover your true sense of self and vocation. Transylvania is a supportive community that is committed to your dreams and your personal, academic and professional achievement. I invite you to join us! Sincerely, Andrew McMichael Executive Vice President for Academic Affairs and Dean of the University Academics Academic Programs Preprofessional Self-Designed Majors KCTCS Transfer Pathways Graduate Partnerships Office of the Academic Dean Dean’s List Dean’s List Archive Creative Intelligence Series Holleian Society Commencement Commencements Archive Transylvania Seminar Seminar Schedule The Liberal Arts Your First Year First Year Seminar Undergraduate Research Academic Requirements Advanced Placement International Baccalaureate Digital Liberal Arts Peace Corps Prep Eligibility and Application Program Requirements University Catalog Academic Services Library Transy Writing Center Library Services Catalogs Special Collections Academic Center for Excellence Faculty Faculty Directory Fine Arts Humanities Natural Sciences and Math Social Sciences Faculty Development Faculty Emeriti Faculty Podcasts Office of the Registrar Browse the Course Schedule Courses FERPA Student Information Release Diploma Requests Transcripts Self Service Access Form Dual Credit Information Transfer Credit Portal Units and Semester Hours Academic Calendar 2025‑26 Academic Calendar 2026‑27 Class Schedule Study Abroad Costs and Scholarships Opportunities GlobalTransy May Term Past Domestic Courses Past International Courses Requirements Travel Resources Center for Entrepreneurship Apply Get Info Visit Make a Gift Connect With Us! Facebook Instagram YouTube TikTok X Linkedin Campus Accessibility Services Maps & Directions Reserving Campus Spaces Transy F.A.Q. Transy Bookstore Transy Jobs Policies Privacy Policy Title IX CARES Act Reporting Campus Policies Resources Calendar of Events Transy Mail Inside Transy Revise Cookie Preferences Transylvania University 300 North Broadway Lexington , KY 40508 USA Phone: 859‐233‐8300 Fax: 859‐233‐8797 Need more information about Transy? Please contact our Office of Admissions at admissions@transy.edu . Transylvania University strives to make website content accessible to all users. If you are having difficulty using or accessing the content on this page, please contact webmaster@transy.edu . For more information about filing a civil rights complaint regarding this website, read these guidelines . © 2026 Transylvania University. All rights reserved. Search for: Search Close Search"
